        "cleanup_zero_and_mode6_callers",
        "vm_abort_calls_zero_setup"
      ]
    },
    {
      "classification": "derived",
      "finding": "BB497C calls BBC380 using receiver slot155BA00; BBC380 supplies initial metadata0 and forwards toBBC3B4. This is a different slot from VM155B988, but the prior IPC evidence binds VM155B988 to that same main receiver during VM setup. It does not establish a separate adapter.",
